# Architecture (docs/diagrams/architecture.d2 — render with d2)
direction: right
user: User browser {
  shape: person
}
web: Flask/gunicorn app :5090
db: SQLite lidl.db {
  shape: cylinder
}
pw: Playwright Chromium
vol_data: ./data volume
vol_receipts: ./receipts volume
grocy: Grocy API {
  shape: cylinder
}
lidl: lidl-hellas.gr {
  shape: cloud
}
user -> web: HTTP :5090
web -> db: reads/writes
web -> pw: drives sync
db -> vol_data: persists
pw -> vol_data: Lidl profile
vol_receipts -> web: receipt texts
web -> grocy: products/stock API
pw -> lidl: purchase history
